{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12210120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12210120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1221012001:1":{"text":"うぐっ……こ、ここは？僕は、生きてるのか……？","source_cn":"呃啊……这、这是哪？我还活着吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE903AA5E3C32122E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221012002:1":{"text":"起きた！起きた！","source_cn":"醒了！醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x006314EF73608A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221012003:1":{"text":"し、植物が喋ってる！これは夢か？それとも、僕はもう……","source_cn":"会……会说话的植物！我一定在做梦……难道我已经……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10BCD33529FA3E67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221012004:1":{"text":"落ち着いてください！もう大丈夫ですよ、傷も全部治ってます！","source_cn":"别紧张！你已经没事了，连身上的伤都好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8495D6732B7C72AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221012005:1":{"text":"ここにいる蛍光花があなたを治したんです。だから怖がらなくて大丈夫ですよ。","source_cn":"是这些荧荧花救了你，所以你不用害怕它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A7A058B9420DAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"